  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **?Tonight?**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 3 archived performances; with Sam Kininger [2]\n- **Liquid**: with Christian Scott & Sam Kininger [2]\n- **Relax**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 4 archived performances [2]\n- **Got Soul**: back after 23 archived shows (853 days); rare: 10 archived performances; with Ivan Neville, Sam Kininger, Ryan Zoidis & Christian Scott [2]\n- **Let A Woman Be A Woman**: back after 79 archived shows (1648 days); mythic rare: 2 archived performances; with Ivan Neville, Sam Kininger, Ryan Zoidis & Christian Scott [2]\n- **Neal Evans solo**: earliest performance in the archive; mythic rare: 2 archived performances [2]\n- **If You Want Me To Stay**: back after 47 archived shows (1168 days); with Ivan Neville, Sam Kininger, Ryan Zoidis & Christian Scott [2]\n- **Be Alright**: earliest performance in the archive; mythic rare: 2 archived performances; with Nigel Hall [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **Soulive2008-04-30** (recommended): source not stated; 18 songs; 156 min [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Guests: Christian Scott & Sam Kininger, Ivan Neville, Sam Kininger, Ryan Zoidis & Christian Scott, Nigel Hall, Nigel Hall, Sam Kininger, Ryan Zoidis & Christian Scott, Sam Kininger [1]\n- Stage talk about: Can't Hide Love [1]\n- Recording was made at One Eyed Jack's in New Orleans, Louisiana [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **Soulive2008-04-30**: Captured with Schoeps MK21 microphones, run through KC5 and CMC6 capsules/amps, then a Lunatec V2 preamp into a Sound Devices 722 recorder at 24-bit/48kHz; Transfer chain: Wavelab for resampling with UV22HR dither, then CDWave Editor, finally encoded to FLAC [1]",
